# and Let's Encrypt certificates; there is no NAT or proxy to narrow it to.
AWS-0104
AVD-AWS-0104
# Ingress 80/443 from 0.0.0.0/0: this is the public web server (Caddy).
AWS-0107
AVD-AWS-0107
# SNS topic without KMS: CloudWatch alarms cannot publish to a topic encrypted
